$CASES/data/zones.tab: entries 5, zones 3
zone Europe/Berlin (named)
zone America/New_York (named)
zone Australia/Lord_Howe (named)
nightly: 30 2 * * * in Europe/Berlin, timeout 5m0s -- jobkit print nightly
hourly: 0 * 29 3 * in Europe/Berlin -- jobkit print hourly
early: 30 1 * * sun in America/New_York -- jobkit print early
howe-back: 45 1 * * * in Australia/Lord_Howe -- jobkit print howe
howe-fwd: 15 2 * * * in Australia/Lord_Howe -- jobkit print howe
